ES2004b 1 FEE016 896.950 927.830 eighty percent would spend more money when a remote control would look fancy we were quite surprised by that finding but um that's quite a high proportion of our our you know international target group are prepared to spend more money for something that's a bit nicer looking um current remote controls do not match well with the operating behaviour of the user overall for example you can see below there seventy five percent of users zap a lot so you've got your person sunk back in the sofa channel hopping so again there's power implications there
